commit 86b2ceb9a5df71eee18bdad0a3f13033d09bf19c

C03: a search report gets the dense budget and three pages at most; no weather claim over a failed search; «investiga» is an action head (WEB1453)

WEB1451 measured that «Investiga Spider-Man» and both variants ended no_response for one cause: the search verified five pages about the topic, the first draft listed all of them with their snippets and was cut by the 256-token budget (rejected as cut_by_length, correctly), but the App grants an ordinary composition five seconds and one long generation consumes them, so the shortened retry never ran. The prohibition «No investigues nada en internet.» was answered as chat with a greeting because «investiga» was not in the prohibition reader's action-head vocabulary. WEB1445 had also shown «Sí, va a llover mañana» composed over a search that returned nothing relevant.

Baxy.App MindSidecarClient: a verified web.search whose results JSON is dense counts as a dense observed inventory, so the composition gets the ten-second budget that listings already receive.
baxy_mind llm: the search instruction asks for at most three pages in at most three sentences; over a web.search without results, a weather assertion is vetoed (search_unsupported_claim) the same way as over results that do not state it.
baxy_mind effect_intent: «investiga», «investigar» and «research» join the coverage action heads, so «no investigues …» is read as a standalone prohibition.

Offline probes: «No investigues nada en internet.» is a prohibition; «Sí, va a llover mañana. Pero no pude confirmarlo…» over a failed search is vetoed while the honest «No encontré resultados pertinentes…» passes; the readers of the next panel are unchanged. App recompiled (BUILD1453). Tests not run (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


